### Managing IAM Users using CLI
- aws iam help : help content
- aws iam create-user --user-name bharath
- aws iam get-user --user-name bharath
- aws iam list-users
- aws iam create-login-profile --user-name bharath --password P@$$word12345 --password-reset-required
- aws iam update-login-profile --user-name bharath : We have to run this to apply profile to user
- aws iam change-password --old-password <old-password> --new-password <new-password> : It changes password of currently logged in IAM user

