### Signing in an AWS IAM User
- In powershell, we can configure access and secret keys as follows
  - $accesskey="<access-key>"
  - $secretkey="<secret-key>"
  - set-awscredential -accesskey $accesskey -secretkey $secretkey -storeas bharath : stores credentials with profile name as bharath
  - initialize-awsdefaultconfiguration -profilename bharath
